{"nodes": [{"id": "specs_archive_workflowhub_thin_core_card_05_20260919_research_step12_stage_end_spec_analyze_gap_step12_gap_analysis", "label": "CARD-05 make-decision step 12 Semantic Gap Analysis", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "specs/archive/workflowhub-thin-core-card-05-20260919/research/STEP12-stage-end-spec-analyze-gap.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "specs_archive_workflowhub_thin_core_card_05_20260919_research_step12_stage_end_spec_analyze_gap_cf6_cf9_undecided", "label": "CF-6 to CF-9 undecided yet materials require user ruling before build-spec", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "specs/archive/workflowhub-thin-core-card-05-20260919/research/STEP12-stage-end-spec-analyze-gap.md", "source_location": "L30-L38", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "B-1 blocking: the four conflicts lack owner/trigger/consumer/close and the last user input was a generic 'confirm, proceed' that never names them; three of them (any-of-N extension, unhandled mode, card-02 handover) change the decision text itself, so carrying them to build-spec pushes the gap downstream."}, {"id": "specs_archive_workflowhub_thin_core_card_05_20260919_research_step12_stage_end_spec_analyze_gap_baseline_type_mismatch", "label": "go/no-go baseline is a document-direction review, candidate corpus is code diff", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "specs/archive/workflowhub-thin-core-card-05-20260919/research/STEP12-stage-end-spec-analyze-gap.md", "source_location": "L48-L52", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "B-3: the only on-disk control-arm data covers a 59,914 B Markdown decision material, while the replaced faces after D-023 are real diff faces; no wh-review baseline exists on a code diff, so go/no-go is structurally undecidable and the user's question about build-code/verify-code quality cannot be answered."}, {"id": "specs_archive_workflowhub_thin_core_card_05_20260919_research_step12_stage_end_spec_analyze_gap_d026_stale_copies", "label": "Deleted D-014 second disjunct still live in parser-authoritative OI records", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "specs/archive/workflowhub-thin-core-card-05-20260919/research/STEP12-stage-end-spec-analyze-gap.md", "source_location": "L54-L61", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "B-4: D-026 removed the 'or an explicit no-problem conclusion' escape, but OI-002 and OI-004 YAML acceptance blocks plus the D-011 risk line still state it, so both escape and unreachable failure condition survive in the machine-read surface."}, {"id": "specs_archive_workflowhub_thin_core_card_05_20260919_research_step12_stage_end_spec_analyze_gap_open002_risk003_unhandled", "label": "card-02 inbound obligations OPEN-002/RISK-003/T-075 never picked up", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "specs/archive/workflowhub-thin-core-card-05-20260919/research/STEP12-stage-end-spec-analyze-gap.md", "source_location": "L63-L67", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "B-5: an upstream OPEN item that names CARD-05 as owner with a close condition is entirely absent from this card's materials, and RF-06's 'already done' narrative hides the still-live half of the defect (formal run path unverified, likely MATERIAL_INCOMPLETE)."}, {"id": "specs_archive_workflowhub_thin_core_card_05_20260919_research_step12_stage_end_spec_analyze_gap_zero_discard_unrecorded", "label": "Baseline '0 discarded' claim has no machine record", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "specs/archive/workflowhub-thin-core-card-05-20260919/research/STEP12-stage-end-spec-analyze-gap.md", "source_location": "L69-L78", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "B-6: the three attempt.json files contain no discarded_facts or unanchored_finding_dropped key, so '0 discarded' is inferred from an absent field; exit=0 and empty stderr likewise rest only on a session-written timestamp file, and usage 'three-layer null' is really two nulls plus an absent key."}], "edges": [{"source": "specs_archive_workflowhub_thin_core_card_05_20260919_research_step12_stage_end_spec_analyze_gap_step12_gap_analysis", "target": "specs_archive_workflowhub_thin_core_card_05_20260919_research_step12_stage_end_spec_analyze_gap_cf6_cf9_undecided", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "specs/archive/workflowhub-thin-core-card-05-20260919/research/STEP12-stage-end-spec-analyze-gap.md", "source_location": "L30", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_archive_workflowhub_thin_core_card_05_20260919_research_step12_stage_end_spec_analyze_gap_step12_gap_analysis", "target": "specs_archive_workflowhub_thin_core_card_05_20260919_research_step12_stage_end_spec_analyze_gap_baseline_type_mismatch", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "specs/archive/workflowhub-thin-core-card-05-20260919/research/STEP12-stage-end-spec-analyze-gap.md", "source_location": "L48", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_archive_workflowhub_thin_core_card_05_20260919_research_step12_stage_end_spec_analyze_gap_step12_gap_analysis", "target": "specs_archive_workflowhub_thin_core_card_05_20260919_research_step12_stage_end_spec_analyze_gap_d026_stale_copies", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "specs/archive/workflowhub-thin-core-card-05-20260919/research/STEP12-stage-end-spec-analyze-gap.md", "source_location": "L54", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_archive_workflowhub_thin_core_card_05_20260919_research_step12_stage_end_spec_analyze_gap_step12_gap_analysis", "target": "specs_archive_workflowhub_thin_core_card_05_20260919_research_step12_stage_end_spec_analyze_gap_open002_risk003_unhandled